    "changed": "P4AOriginalFiniteFallbackWallRate.changed_seen/rate accepts arbitrary tags at source level, with F at zero roughness; P4AOriginalFiniteFallbackProjection.rough_equal transports physical cutoff for arbitrary tag, conditionally on original stated premises.",
